WEBVTT

00:34:26.750 --> 00:34:30.893
but understanding other people's interests
is always a core skill.

00:34:30.917 --> 00:34:34.059
Whether you're negotiating
your salary, closing a deal

00:34:34.083 --> 00:34:37.559
or even just trying
to get a discount on a couch,

00:34:37.583 --> 00:34:39.726
or a free Cinnataco,

00:34:39.750 --> 00:34:41.059
to get what you want,

00:34:41.083 --> 00:34:43.809
it helps to figure out
what other people want.

00:34:43.833 --> 00:34:45.893
If you can offer them something they value

00:34:45.917 --> 00:34:48.684
based in genuine, deep understanding,

00:34:48.708 --> 00:34:51.393
you don't just end up with better results,

00:34:51.417 --> 00:34:54.809
you also come away
with stronger relationships.

00:34:54.833 --> 00:34:57.667
(Upbeat music)